---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import BookingCta from '../components/BookingCta.astro';
import QuoteGrid from '../components/QuoteGrid.astro';
import ProcessSteps from '../components/ProcessSteps.astro';
import Principles from '../components/Principles.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Meet the Studio | Ashbi Design" description="Meet Bianca and Cameron, the people behind Ashbi Design, a family-owned Toronto branding and web studio."><main id="main">
<section class="interior-hero container studio-hero"><span class="eyebrow">A TORONTO CREATIVE STUDIO</span><h1>Design as personal as <em>the people behind it.</em></h1><p>We build brands and digital experiences by getting to know the ideas, ambitions, and people that make each business different.</p><div class="studio-hero-images"><img src="/images/ashbi/studio-desk.webp" alt="A working day at the Ashbi studio" width="1400" height="933" /><img src="/images/ashbi/studio-detail.webp" alt="A closer look inside the studio" width="1080" height="1080" /></div></section>
<section class="section container case-story"><div><span class="eyebrow">WHO WE ARE</span><h2>Close collaborators. <em>Big picture thinkers.</em></h2></div><div><p>Ashbi is a family-owned design studio based in Toronto. Bianca and Cameron bring brand storytelling, visual design, and digital development into one working relationship.</p><p>We’re interested in what makes your business yours. The people behind it, the audience you’re reaching, and the details that make the experience feel right.</p><p>From a product’s first packaging to the website that introduces it to the world, we look at how each piece connects. You work directly with us as we shape the direction and bring it to life.</p></div></section>
<section class="container principles-section" aria-label="Our working principles"><Principles /></section>
<section class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">THE PEOPLE</span><h2>Meet your <em>creative partners.</em></h2></div><div class="team-grid"><article><img src="/images/ashbi/bianca.webp" alt="Bianca at work in the studio" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="683" /><span>CREATIVE DIRECTION</span><h3>Bianca</h3><p>Bianca creates brand strategies through storytelling and art. Her background in marketing and art informs a thoughtful approach to identities, packaging, and the worlds built around them.</p><p>Outside the studio, she loves interior design and making spaces feel special, alongside time with the family’s two children.</p></article><article><img src="/images/ashbi/cameron.webp" alt="Cameron at work in the studio" loading="lazy" width="720" height="1080" /><span>DIGITAL STRATEGY & DEVELOPMENT</span><h3>Cameron</h3><p>Cameron brings SEO, digital marketing, and more than a decade of IT experience to the studio. He connects creative direction with the technical work behind a useful digital presence.</p><p>Outside work, you’ll find him spending time with the family, reading, or getting his hands on a new gadget.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section process-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">HOW WE WORK</span><h2>Clear steps. <em>Close collaboration.</em></h2></div><ProcessSteps /></div></section>
<section class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">CLIENT WORDS</span><h2>Relationships that <em>matter.</em></h2></div><QuoteGrid /></section>
<BookingCta /></main></BaseLayout>
